
  CREATE OR REPLACE EDITIONABLE PACKAGE "BIZTALK"."PKG_E_INVOICING" IS

/*********************************************************************************************

    Program Name    :	PKG_E_INVOICING

    Description		:	Procedures for E-Invoicing

    Date written 	:   01-May-2024

    Author			:	Kyle Floros

    Notes           :
        - Records where F550301H.EDSP = 'D' was done as part of a PDU.
          Records will not normally update to status 'D'.

    Change Log      :

        CHG093908 - 01-Aug-2024 - New

        CHG094158 - 23-Aug-2024 - Kyle Floros
            - Added Procedures and functions for QR Code Integration

		CHG094774 - 27-Aug-2024 - Kyle Floros
            - Added Self-Billing procedures

        CHG095202 - 14-Oct-2024 - Kyle Floros
            - Self-Billing - New hardcoded dates
            - Self-Billing - Added additional Payment Terms for Prepaids

        CHG095203 - 31-Oct-2024 - Kyle Floros
            - All Polling and XML Select
                - Adding conditions to reprocess status I and P
            - Self Billing
                - Remove Discounts
                - Formatting of Customs Import ID
                - Find run dates dynamically using new function
            - Romania XML Selects
                - Hardcoding of Romania Seller Name

        CHG095872 - 25-Nov-2024 - Kyle Floros
            - Doc Status Update change so UUID, LongID, Date Validated
              pulls in for all records (still only send QR code for MY AR)
            - Update audit fields when updating edsp to I in XML SELECTs
            - Fix reprocessing logic to look back 24 hours properly
            - Change IssueDate for MY AR and Self Bill to use UTC

        CHG096837 - 28-Jan-2025 - Kyle Floros / Bill Chermak
            - Retry count for Doc Status Polling / Select
            - Order By for Doc Status Select
            - Exclude SO/S1+DO billing for MY AR Invoice and Credit Note XML Select

        CHG098344 - 15-Apr-2025 - Bill Chermak
            - Within the MY Select statements need to update the phone numbers
              for buyers and suppliers to follow the new MY Government format

        CHG098493 - 25-Apr-2025 - Bill Chermak / Kyle Floros
            - For Issue Date in AR, force it to use SYSTIMESTAMP if it is not the first
              attempt at processing the record
            - Change condition to use GL date instead of date last updated in case
              the recorded was modified by a PDU or maintenance screen
              ehurdt < v_dates_obj.start_date

        CHG098725 - 09-May-2025 - Bill Chermak / Kyle Floros
            - Pass F550301H.URDT into get dates function for self-bill
            - Use URDT instead of UPMJ in where clause for self-bill
            - Change issue date to use system date for AR
            - UOM UDC lookup

        CHG099053 - 22-May-2025 - Kyle Floros
            - Change Country Sub Entity code from '00' to '17'

		CHG100219 - XX-July-2025 - Bill Chermak
			- Added in new Romanian VAT rates in RO Invoice and Credit Note

		CHG103499 - 21-Jan-2026
			- Adjusted tracking number in MY self-bill to just return alpha and numberics to prevent
			  documents from being rejected by the government protal

/*********************************************************************************************/

